{"id":"25f120c26bfc86b7","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-binary-oracle-jump.md","title":"Turing Jump","display":"df-turing-jump — Turing Jump","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-binary-oracle-jump","aliases":["73-df-binary-oracle-jump","73-df-turing-jump"],"display":"df-turing-jump — Turing Jump","depends_on":["[[73-df-oracle-program-semantics]]","[[73-df-binary-oracle-decision]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-binary-oracle-jump"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-binary-oracle-jump</span><span>73-df-turing-jump</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-turing-jump — Turing Jump"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ab6c7ca255afa826\" href=\"?note=ab6c7ca255afa826\" title=\"73-df-oracle-program-semantics\">73-df-oracle-program-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fd5cc3818e5e9993\" href=\"?note=fd5cc3818e5e9993\" title=\"73-df-binary-oracle-decision\">73-df-binary-oracle-decision</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbf 2^*\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbf 2^*\\)</span> (oracle language)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O}\">\\(\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O}\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OracleProgramCoding}(\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O})\">\\(\\operatorname{OracleProgramCoding}(\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O})\\)</span> (oracle-program coding, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ab6c7ca255afa826\" href=\"?note=ab6c7ca255afa826\" title=\"73-df-oracle-program-semantics\">73-df-oracle-program-semantics</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OHalts}_O^A\">\\(\\operatorname{OHalts}_O^A\\)</span> (oracle halting predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}jump}\\vdash\nA&#39;_{\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O}}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\ulcorner O\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O}}:\nO\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{OTM}}\\land\n\\operatorname{OHalts}_O^A(\\ulcorner O\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O}})\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}jump}\\vdash\nA&#39;_{\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O}}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\ulcorner O\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O}}:\nO\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{OTM}}\\land\n\\operatorname{OHalts}_O^A(\\ulcorner O\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O}})\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The oracle-program code is a genuine parameter of the jump. Any two acceptable effective coding packages yield Turing-equivalent jumps.</li>\n<li>For the empty oracle, this diagonal oracle-halting language is Turing-equivalent to the ordinary diagonal halting language.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-oracle-program-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"ab6c7ca255afa826","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-oracle-program-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-oracle-decision","status":"resolved","id":"fd5cc3818e5e9993","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-oracle-decision]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-oracle-program-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"ab6c7ca255afa826","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O}$ with $\\operatorname{OracleProgramCoding}(\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O})$ (oracle-program coding, see [[73-df-oracle-program-semantics]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbf 2^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OracleProgramCoding}(\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OHalts}_O^A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}jump}\\vdash\nA'_{\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O}}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\ulcorner O\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O}}:\nO\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{OTM}}\\land\n\\operatorname{OHalts}_O^A(\\ulcorner O\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O}})\\}","display":true}],"bytes":1175,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["ab6c7ca255afa826","fd5cc3818e5e9993"]}